<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's National Dev rises 19.57 pct.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's National Dev rises 19.57 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's National Development Leasing Corp five-rupee stock rose 2.25 rupees, or 19.57 percent, to 13.75 at the Karachi Stock Exchange on fresh buying of one of the oldest leasing companies operating in Pakistan, dealers said.</p>
<p>Some 72,000 shares transactions took place in early trade at the exchange, one dealer said.</p>
<p>The firm paid a 30 percent cash dividend for 18 months ended June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
